## 2. Architecture Decision: Python FastAPI Backend ✅

### Validation Evidence

| Criterion | Webhook + Python | MCP Server | n8n Workflow |
|-----------|------------------|------------|--------------|
| **Production Scale** | ✅ Unlimited (horizontal) | ⚠️ Less mature | ❌ Timeout issues |
| **No Hallucination** | ✅ Deterministic code | ❌ LLM decides tools | ❌ LLM in data path |
| **Edge Case Handling** | ✅ Full control | ⚠️ Depends on LLM | ⚠️ Hard to debug |
| **Maintainability** | ✅ Standard Python | ⚠️ Complex | ❌ Visual builder limits |
| **Latency** | ✅ <100ms | ⚠️ Context overhead | ❌ Multiple LLM calls |

**Chosen**: Python FastAPI Backend with Webhook

