## 6. Patient Data Extraction ✅

### Research: Custom Parameters vs Transcript

| Data Type | Method | Reason |
|-----------|--------|--------|
| first_name | Custom param | Critical, exact match |
| last_name | Custom param | Critical, exact match |
| phone_number | Custom param | Unique identifier |
| email | Custom param | For Gmail confirmation |
| appointment_date | Custom param | Critical for booking |
| appointment_time | Custom param | Critical for booking |
| eye_concern | Transcript | Flexible description |
| insurance | Custom param | Structured data |
| age | Custom param | Numeric, exact |

**Vapi Best Practice**: "Pass parameters directly into the function as given. Do not modify user input."

