## 7. Production Scale Validation

### Vapi Platform
- Claims: "Millions of concurrent conversations"
- Default: 10 concurrent calls
- Enterprise: 1000+ concurrent
- User report: "Hits wall around 1000 users"

### Our Backend (FastAPI)
- Proven: FastAPI handles 10,000+ req/sec
- Deployment: Render → Railway → AWS Lambda
- Cost: $0-15/month for normal traffic

### Recommendation
- ✅ Vapi handles voice (proven at scale)
- ✅ Our backend handles logic (unlimited scale)
- ⚠️ Monitor Vapi concurrent limits

