## 8. Edge Cases Checklist

### Date/Time Parsing
| Case | Handling | Validated |
|------|----------|-----------|
| "Next Friday" | `dateparser` → correct future date | ✅ |
| "Tomorrow" | `dateparser` → tomorrow's date | ✅ |
| "This week" | Range: Mon-Sun | ✅ |
| Past date | Reject with message | ✅ |
| Sunday | "We are closed on Sundays" | ✅ |

### Availability Queries
| Case | Handling | Validated |
|------|----------|-----------|
| Single day | Return that day's slots | ✅ |
| Range query | Return 7 days | ✅ |
| No slots | Rolling window | ✅ |
| All-day event | Day blocked | ✅ |
| API timeout | Retry + message | ✅ |

### Booking Flow
| Case | Handling | Validated |
|------|----------|-----------|
| Patient exists | Update record | ✅ |
| New patient | Create record | ✅ |
| Slot taken | Re-check before booking | ✅ |
| No email | Skip Gmail | ✅ |

