## 9. Hallucination Prevention

### ✅ What We Use (Deterministic)
- Date parsing: `dateparser` library
- Intent classification: Rule-based keywords
- Slot calculation: Python math
- Data storage: Supabase queries

### ❌ What We Avoid (Hallucination Risk)
- LLM for date math
- LLM for slot calculations
- LLM for intent classification
- LLM in data processing path

### LLM Role (Safe)
- Conversation with user
- Speech understanding
- Natural language responses
- NOT data processing

